  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Urban Food Security, Livelihoods &amp; Markets Programme (UFSLM) - Deutsche Gesellschaft Fuer Internationale Zusammenarbeit (GIZ) - Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) is a component of Urban Food Security, Livelihoods and Markets reported by FCDO with a funding type of 112 - Other bilateral donor and a budget of &#xA3;5,281,414. It works in the following sector(s): Agricultural development, Vocational training, Small and medium-sized enterprises (SME) development, Informal/semi-formal financial intermediaries.</narrative>
